{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":26,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܥܒ݂ܘܿܕ ܠܵܗ̇ ܕܝܼܘܵܢܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܐܵܢܵܐ ܒܬܲܡܝܼܡܘܼܬ‌ܝܼ ܚܕܝܼܪܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܦܝܼܫ ܠܝܼ ܒܣܲܒ݂ܪܵܐ، ܠܹܐ ܫܵܥܫܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܚܘܿܪ ܐܸܠܝܼ، ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܘܓ̰ܲܪܸܒ ܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܨܲܪܸܦ ܪܸܥܝܵܢܝܼ ܘܠܸܒܝܼ؛","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂ ܩܲܕܡ ܥܲܝܢܝܼ̈ ܝܠܵܗ̇،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܚܕܝܼܪܝܼ ܒܡܗܘܼܡܢܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܵܐ ܝܬܝܼܒ݂ ܠܝܼ ܥܲܡ ܡܲܚܠܸܛܵܢܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܥܲܡ ܡܲܫܦܸܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܠܹܐ ܥܵܒ݂ܕܹܢ ܫܵܘܬܵܦܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܢܹܐ ܠܝܼ ܠܟܢܘܼܫܝܵܐ ܕܥܵܒ݂ܕܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܥܲܡ ܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ ܠܹܐ ܝܵܬܒܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܚܲܠܸܠܸܢ ܒܙܲܟܵܝܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܐܝܼܕܵܬ‌ܝܼ̈،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܚܵܕܪܹܢ ܠܚܵܕܸܪ̈ܘܵܢܹܐ ܕܡܲܕܒܚܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܡܲܫܡܘܼܥܹܐ ܩܵܠܵܐ ܕܫܲܟܲܪܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܗܲܩܘܼܝܹܐ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܥܲܓ̰ܝܼܒܘܼܝܵܬܘܼ̈ܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܡܘܼܚܸܒ ܠܝܼ ܠܡܲܥܡܪܵܐ ܕܒܲܝܬܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܘܼܟܵܐ ܕܫܵܪܹܐ ܫܘܼܒ݂ܚܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܵܐ ܛܲܠܩܸܬ ܠܵܗ̇ ܓܵܢܝܼ ܥܲܡ ܚܲܛܵܝܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܦܠܵܐ ܚܲܝܝܼ̈ ܥܲܡ ܫܲܦܟ݂ܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܕܸܡܵܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܝܢܝܼ ܕܒܐܝܼܕܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܐܝܼܬ ܨܢܝܼܥܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܝܲܡܝܼܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܡܠܝܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܪܸܫܘܲܬ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܵܢܵܐ، ܒܬܲܡܝܼܡܘܼܬ‌ܝܼ ܒܸܬ ܚܵܕܪܹܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܲܪܸܩ ܠܝܼ ܘܪܲܚܸܡ ܥܲܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܩܠܝܼ ܟܠܹܐ ܠܵܗ̇ ܒܕܘܼܟܵܐ ܬܪܘܼܨܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܓܵܘ ܟܸܢܫܹ̈ܐ ܒܸܬ ܒܲܪܟܸܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/26.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/27.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/25.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}